  "description": "Experience pure riding fun with the Backroad AL Apex XPLR 1x12! It is equipped with the new mechanical SRAM Apex XPLR 1x12 gravel shifting group, robust and off-road-specific ROSE G25 gravel wheels encased in Conti gravel tyres as well as comfortable gravel handlebar with anatomically-shaped lower bends. In other words, this gravel bike is perfect for gravel enthusiasts who are looking for a challenge off-road and on trails. More versatility Doesn’t matter if you’re getting some single-trail action, commuting through the city, or on a bike-packing adventure. Kick it into high gear, go gravel, and experience freedom at its best: the aluminium gravel bike Backroad AL makes it all possible. Where will the next great adventure take you? More adventure No adventure is too big! Thanks to gravel-specific geometry and well-designed features such as the downtube protector and countless attachment points for bottle holders, Anything Cages, or bags, the Backroad AL is the perfect companion for outdoor adventures. Max propulsion down the trail with a tyre clearance of up to 47 mm with 650b wheels or 45 mm with 700c wheels – all great qualities for lots of off-roading fun. More design With the Backroad AL you’ll always look good on the bike. Whether you’re on the way to work or on a gravel track. Show off that ultimate two-wheel swag thanks to the beautiful frame design in carbon-look with smooth seams, clear lines, and a super-clean cockpit, which offers full integration of cables and hoses. ¹ approx. 9.7 kg, may vary by up to +/- 5 % due to manufacturing tolerances, weight for frame colour dijon, size 57 cm, without pedals",
